// Sphere of Ultimate Destruction

// @0 = ~~  // #7222
@1 = ~Sphere of Ultimate Destruction~

// @10 = ~~ // #-1
@11 = ~Sphere of Ultimate Destruction
(Conjuration/Summoning)

Level: 9
Range: Visual range of the caster
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: Special

This spell brings into existence a short-lived sphere of annihilation. The sphere is a black ball of nothingness about 4 feet in diameter that instantly and utterly destroys any matter that comes into contact with it. The caster has no further control over the sphere once it has been summoned. It will hover around the area, harming friend and foe alike. Enemies touched by the sphere must save vs. Breath Weapon at a -4 penalty or be utterly destroyed. Allies touched by the sphere must save vs. Breath Weapon without penalties or be utterly destroyed. A creature that successfully saves still receives 2d8+1 points of damage. The caster is immune to the effect of the sphere.~
